---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CenteredLayout from '../layouts/CenteredLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title='Home' description='Home'>
  <CenteredLayout>
    <div class='card card-border'>
      <div class='card-body'>
        <h1 class='card-title font-extrabold'>Kenil Sudani</h1>
        <p>Friendly Neighbourhood Developer</p>
        <!-- <p class='text-stone-300'>Frequently Laughs, Rarely Sleeps, Helps Everyone, Never Exists Until Bug Appears, Helpful On Odd Hours, Overworked Developer, Debugs Everything, Very Enthusiastic, Panics Frequently, Repeats</p> -->
        <a href='/about' class='link'>The Story</a>

        <ul class='list rounded-box shadow-md'>
          <li class='p-4 pb-2 text-xs opacity-60 tracking-wide'>Current Benchmarks I'm trying to surpass</li>

          <li class='list-row'>
            <div><img class='size-10 rounded-box' src='https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/1@94.webp' /></div>
            <div>
              <div>Dio Lupa</div>
              <p class='list-col-wrap text-xs'>"Remaining Reason" became an instant hit, praised for its haunting sound and emotional depth. A viral performance brought it widespread recognition, making it one of Dio Lupa’s most iconic tracks.</p>
            </div>
            <button class='btn btn-square btn-ghost'>
              <svg class='size-[1.2em]' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><g stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='2' fill='none' stroke='currentColor'><path d='M6 3L20 12 6 21 6 3z'></path></g></svg>
            </button>
          </li>

          <li class='list-row'>
            <div><img class='size-10 rounded-box' src='https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/4@94.webp' /></div>
            <div>
              <div>Ellie Beilish</div>
              <p class='list-col-wrap text-xs'>"Bears of a Fever" captivated audiences with its intense energy and mysterious lyrics. Its popularity skyrocketed after fans shared it widely online, earning Ellie critical acclaim.</p>
            </div>
            <button class='btn btn-square btn-ghost'>
              <svg class='size-[1.2em]' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><g stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='2' fill='none' stroke='currentColor'><path d='M6 3L20 12 6 21 6 3z'></path></g></svg>
            </button>
          </li>

          <li class='list-row'>
            <div><img class='size-10 rounded-box' src='https://img.daisyui.com/images/profile/demo/3@94.webp' /></div>
            <div>
              <div>Sabrino Gardener</div>
              <p class='list-col-wrap text-xs'>"Cappuccino" quickly gained attention for its smooth melody and relatable themes. The song’s success propelled Sabrino into the spotlight, solidifying their status as a rising star.</p>
            </div>
            <button class='btn btn-square btn-ghost'>
              <svg class='size-[1.2em]' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><g stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-width='2' fill='none' stroke='currentColor'><path d='M6 3L20 12 6 21 6 3z'></path></g></svg>
            </button>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </CenteredLayout>
</BaseLayout>
